I like this story!

21
00:02:21.889 --> 00:02:26.933
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:26.983 --> 00:02:28.133
Cardio!

23
00:02:29.113 --> 00:02:34.364
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:34.414 --> 00:02:35.564
Hydration!

25
00:02:36.519 --> 00:02:44.321
Think and answer. What healthy habit would you like to build?

26
